   \n                            公文种类：通知\n                            发布机构：四川省财政厅 四川省科学技术厅\n                            成文日期：2025-06-27\n                            发布日期：2025-07-08\n                            文  号：川财规〔2025〕10号\n                            有 效 性 ：有效\n                            废止日期： 1846137600000\n                        "}],"unique_index":"cm0g57na7pmmeqns4np","iframe":false,"default":"","paraType":"text","recordASField":1,"beforeJS":"","beforeJSWaitTime":0,"JS":"","JSWaitTime":0,"afterJS":"","afterJSWaitTime":0,"downloadPic":0,"splitLine":0},{"nodeType":0,"contentType":0,"relative":false,"name":"标题","desc":"","relativeXPath":"/html/body/form[1]/div[2]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[1]/div[1]/h1[1]","allXPaths":["/html/body/form[1]/div[2]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[1]/div[1]/h1[1]","//h1[contains(., '四川省财政厅 四川省')]","/html/body/form/div/div/div/div/div/div[last()-1]/h1"],"exampleValues":[{"num":0,"value":"四川省财政厅 四川省科学技术厅关于印发《省级财政科技计划专项资金管理办法》的通知"}],"unique_index":"i1vd1c8jo9cmeqns4np","iframe":false,"default":"","paraType":"text","recordASField":1,"beforeJS":"","beforeJSWaitTime":0,"JS":"","JSWaitTime":0,"afterJS":"","afterJSWaitTime":0,"downloadPic":0,"splitLine":0},{"nodeType":0,"contentType":0,"relative":false,"name":"正文","desc":"","relativeXPath":"/html/body/form[1]/div[2]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[1]/div[1]","allXPaths":["/html/body/form[1]/div[2]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[1]/div[1]","//div[contains(., '')]","//div[@class='artleft']","/html/body/form/div/div/div/div/div/div[last()-1]"],"exampleValues":[{"num":0,"value":"\n                              \t四川省财政厅 四川省科学技术厅关于印发《省级财政科技计划专项资金管理办法》的通知\n          \n            \t\t\t\t\t\n              \t\t\t\t\t\t\n            \t\t\t\t\t\n                              \n                                \n                                    各市（州）、扩权县（市）财政局、科技行政主管部门，省级有关部门（单位）：\n为规范和加强省级财政科技计划专项资金管理，提高资金使用绩效，根据《中华人民共和国预算法》及其实施条例、《中共四川省委办公厅 四川省人民政府办公厅关于深入实施预算绩效管理的通知》（川委厅〔2022〕5号）、《四川省财政厅 四川省科学技术厅印发<关于改革完善省级财政科研经费管理的实施意见>的通知》（川财规〔2022〕10号）等有关规定，结合科技计划管理工作实际，财政厅、科技厅制定了《省级财政科技计划专项资金管理办法》。现印发你们，请遵照执行。\n \n \n  四川省财政厅     四川省科学技术厅\n2025年6月27日\n\n                                \n                              \n                                \n                 \t \t\t\t\t附件：\n                  \t\t\t\t\t\n省级财政科技计划专项资金管理办法.pdf\n                  \t\t\t\t\t\n                \t\t\t\t\n                              \n                            "}],"unique_index":"giecs8k2dcsmeqns4np","iframe":false,"default":"","paraType":"text","recordASField":1,"beforeJS":"","beforeJSWaitTime":0,"JS":"","JSWaitTime":0,"afterJS":"","afterJSWaitTime":0,"downloadPic":0,"splitLine":1},{"nodeType":0,"contentType":5,"relative":false,"name":"URL","desc":"","extractType":0,"relativeXPath":"/html/body/form[1]/div[2]/div[1]/div[2]/div[1]/ul[1]/li[6]","allXPaths":["/html/body/form[1]/div[2]/div[1]/div[2]/div[1]/ul[1]/li[6]","//li[contains(., '文  号：川财规〔2')]","/html/body/form/div/div/div/div[last()-1]/ul/li[last()-2]"],"exampleValues":[{"num":0,"value":"https://kjt.sc.gov.cn/kjt/qtwj/2025/7/8/e8335bf1ace54a7ab9ffdcaf51a17567.shtml"}],"unique_index":"hcqw092f1umeqpqgxs","iframe":false,"default":"","paraType":"text","recordASField":1,"beforeJS":"","beforeJSWaitTime":0,"JS":"","JSWaitTime":0,"afterJS":"","afterJSWaitTime":0,"downloadPic":0,"splitLine":0}]}}]}